单边拉普拉斯变换的性质
－卷积特性：若 \(x_{1}(t) \stackrel{\mathcal{L}}{\leftrightarrow} X_{1}(s), \sigma&gt;\sigma_{1} ; x_{2}(t) \stackrel{\mathcal{L}}{\leftrightarrow} X_{2}(s), \sigma&gt;\sigma_{2}\) ，则
\[
\begin{gathered}
x_{1}(t) * x_{2}(t) \stackrel{\mathcal{L}}{\leftrightarrow} X_{1}(s) X_{2}(s) \\
\sigma&gt;\max \left(\sigma_{1}, \sigma_{2}\right)
\end{gathered}
\]
－乘积特性：若 \(x_{1}(t) \stackrel{\mathcal{L}}{\leftrightarrow} X_{1}(s), \sigma&gt;\sigma_{1} ; x_{2}(t) \stackrel{\mathcal{L}}{\leftrightarrow} X_{2}(s), \sigma&gt;\sigma_{2}\) ，则
\[
\begin{gathered}
x_{1}(t) x_{2}(t) \stackrel{\mathcal{L}}{\leftrightarrow} \frac{1}{2 \pi j}\left[X_{1}(s) * X_{2}(s)\right] \\
\sigma&gt;\sigma_{1}+\sigma_{2}
\end{gathered}
\]

单边拉普拉斯的反变换计算
－对于LT的结果，一般可以表示为
\[
\begin{aligned}
X(s) & =\frac{N(s)}{D(s)}=\frac{b_{m} s^{m}+b_{m-1} s^{m-1}+\cdots+b_{1} s+b_{0}}{s^{n}+a_{n-1} s^{n-1}+\cdots+a_{1} s+a_{0}} \\
& =\frac{b_{m}\left(s-z_{1}\right)\left(s-z_{2}\right) \cdots\left(s-z_{m}\right)}{\left(s-p_{1}\right)\left(s-p_{2}\right) \cdots\left(s-p_{n}\right)} \text { 零点 }^{\text {极点 }}
\end{aligned}
\]
－\(X(s)\) 为有理真分式 \((m&lt;n)\) ，极点为一阶极点
\[
\begin{gathered}
X(s)=\frac{N(s)}{D(s)}=\frac{N(s)}{\left(s-p_{1}\right)\left(s-p_{2}\right) \cdots\left(s-p_{n}\right)}=\frac{k_{1}}{s-p_{1}}+\frac{k_{2}}{s-p_{2}}+\cdots+\frac{k_{n}}{s-p_{n}} \\
k_{i}=\left.\left(s-p_{i}\right) X(s)\right|_{s=p_{i}} \quad i=1,2, \cdots, n \\
x(t)=\left(k_{1} \mathrm{e}^{p_{1} t}+k_{2} \mathrm{e}^{p_{2} t}+\cdots+k_{n} \mathrm{e}^{p_{n} t}\right) u(t)
\end{gathered}
\]

微分方程描述系统的复频域分析
系统的微分方程为 \(y^{\prime \prime}(t)+5 y^{\prime}(t)+6 y(t)=2 x^{\prime}(t)+8 x(t)\) ，激励 \(x(t)=e^{-t} u(t)\) ，初始状态 \(y\left(0_{-}\right)=3, ~ y^{\prime}\left(0_{-}\right)=2\) ，求响应 \(y(t)\) 。 －对微分方程进行单边LT可得
\[
\begin{gathered}
Y_{z s}(s)=\frac{2 s+8}{s^{2}+5 s+6} \cdot \frac{1}{s+1}=\frac{2 s+8}{(s+2)(s+3)} \cdot \frac{1}{s+1} \\
=\frac{3}{s+1}-\frac{4}{s+2}+\frac{1}{(s+3)}
\end{gathered}
\]

因此 \(y_{z S}(t)=\mathcal{L}^{-1}\left\{Y_{z S}(s)\right\}=\left(3 \mathrm{e}^{-t}-4 \mathrm{e}^{-2 t}+\mathrm{e}^{-3 t}\right) \cdot u(t)\)
综上：\(y(t)=y_{z i}(t)+y_{z s}(t)=3 \mathrm{e}^{-t}+7 \mathrm{e}^{-2 t}-7 \mathrm{e}^{-3 t}, t \geq 0\)

